{"title": "Human Versatility", "pageid": 6573, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Human_Versatility", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp, /w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Human Versatility</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Humans</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in a skill of their choice and <a href=\"/wiki/Carrying_Capacity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Carrying Capacity\">Carrying Capacity</a> is increased by a quarter.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Select an additional <a href=\"/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">Skill</a> to be <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> in. Your carrying capacity is increased by a quarter. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Maddala_Deadeye\" title=\"Maddala Deadeye\">Maddala Deadeye</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Stacks linearly with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vaprak%27s_Greed\" title=\"Vaprak's Greed\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp/25px-Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp/38px-Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/da/Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp/50px-Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vaprak's Greed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/da/Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp/25px-Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/da/Vaprak%27s_Greed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vaprak%27s_Greed\" title=\"Vaprak's Greed\">Vaprak's Greed</a>, granting a total of 50% more carrying capacity.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> with an additional <a href=\"/wiki/Skill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill\">skill</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Carrying_capacity\" title=\"Carrying capacity\">carrying capacity</a> increased by a quarter.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194659\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.0